ties?</h2><p style="color:var(--muted);line-height:1.75;max-width:720px;margin-bottom:1rem">Each of the four is 3 to 10 minutes by car from a hospital, without traffic.</p><figure style="margin:1.8rem 0;max-width:760px"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" id="c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co" viewBox="0 0 360 361" width="360" height="361" role="img" aria-label="Hospitals near the 55+ communities: a map of 8 places, numbered 1, Myrtle Trace; 2, Seasons at Prince Creek West; 3, Del Webb at Grande Dunes; 4, Del Webb North Myrtle Beach; 5, Conway Medical Center; 6, Grand Strand Medical Center; 7, Tidelands Waccamaw Community Hospital; and 8, McLeod Health Seacoast." style="display:block;width:100%;height:auto;max-width:760px;background:#f7f3ec;border:1px solid rgba(28,32,40,.15)"><style>#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co text{font-family:'DM Sans',system-ui,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',sans-serif;paint-order:stroke;stroke:#f7f3ec;stroke-width:3px;stroke-linejoin:round;fill:#1c2028}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .h{font:500 17px 'Fraunces',Georgia,serif}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .l{font-size:14px;font-weight:500}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .m{font-size:13px;font-weight:500;fill:#91592b}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .t{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.1em;fill:#5c6b78}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .T{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.1em;fill:#3b4450}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .o{font:italic 400 15px 'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:.06em;fill:#3f6275;stroke:#c9dde6}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .p{font-size:14px;font-weight:500;fill:#4a6640}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .f{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.1em;fill:#1c2028}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .r{font-size:11px;font-weight:500;stroke:none;fill:#1c2028}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .q{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.04em}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .wc{font:italic 400 14px 'Fraunces',Georgia,serif;fill:#3f6275}#c3r-hospitals-near-the-55-co .l{font-size:15px}#c3r-hospi